<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AX 전략실 오늘의 뉴스 · {{ date }}</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#17171a; --sub:#8a8a90; --bg:#f5f5f3; --card:#ffffff;
    --line:#e9e9e6; --black:#0b0b0c; --hair:#26262a;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);
       font-family:'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Pretendard','Malgun Gothic',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
       line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;letter-spacing:-.005em;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  /* ── 헤더(블랙) ── */
  header{background:var(--black);color:#fff;padding:40px 24px 30px;}
  header .wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;}
  header .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.34em;color:#76767e;
                  text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:11px;}
  header h1{margin:0;font-size:25px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em;}
  header .meta{margin-top:9px;color:#9c9ca3;font-size:13px;}
  nav.dates{background:var(--black);padding:0 24px 22px;}
  nav.dates .wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:6px;
                  overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:2px;}
  nav.dates a{flex:none;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;
              text-decoration:none;color:#9c9ca3;border:1px solid var(--hair);
              transition:.15s;}
  nav.dates a:hover{color:#fff;}
  nav.dates a.on{background:#fff;color:var(--black);font-weight:600;border-color:#fff;}
  nav.dates a.home{color:#cececf;border-color:transparent;padding-left:0;}

  /* ── 본문 ── */
  main{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:30px 24px 6px;}
  details.cat{margin-bottom:8px;}
  details.cat>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;
       gap:11px;padding:15px 2px 13px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);
       font-size:16.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;user-select:none;}
  details.cat>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  details.cat>summary .count{color:var(--sub);font-weight:500;font-size:12.5px;
       border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);
       padding:1px 8px;border-radius:99px;}
  details.cat>summary .chev{margin-left:auto;color:var(--sub);font-size:12px;
       transition:transform .2s ease;}
  details.cat:not([open])>summary .chev{transform:rotate(-90deg);}
  details.cat:not([open])>summary{border-bottom-color:var(--line);}

  .grid{display:grid;gap:16px;padding:20px 0 22px;
        grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(284px,1fr));}
  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
        overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
        transition:transform .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease;}
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(11,11,12,.11);}
  .thumb{display:block;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#e7e7e3;overflow:hidden;}
  .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  .body{padding:15px 16px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;flex:1;}
  .title{font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.46;letter-spacing:-.015em;
         text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);
         display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;}
  .summary{margin:0;font-size:12.8px;color:#5f5f66;line-height:1.6;flex:1;
           display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;}
  .meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--sub);
        border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:10px;margin-top:2px;}
  .src{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}
  .read{margin-left:auto;text-decoration:none;color:var(--sub);transition:.15s;}
  .card:hover .read{color:var(--ink);}

  /* ── 의견 보내기 ── */
  .feedback{max-width:1140px;margin:10px auto 0;padding:20px 24px 0;}
  .fb-card{background:var(--black);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;
           padding:30px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}
  .fb-card h2{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
  .fb-card p{margin:0 0 18px;color:#9c9ca3;font-size:13px;max-width:560px;}
  .fb-btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--black);text-decoration:none;
          padding:11px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;
          transition:.15s;}
  .fb-btn:hover{background:#d8d8d8;}
  footer{max-width:1140px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px 24px;color:var(--sub);
         font-size:11.5px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.01em;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">AX 전략실</div>
    <h1>오늘의 뉴스</h1>
    <div class="meta">{{ date }} · 큐레이션 기사 {{ count }}건</div>
  </div>
</header>
<nav class="dates">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="home" href="index.html">← 전체 아카이브</a>
    {% for d in all_dates %}
      <a href="{{ d }}.html" class="{{ 'on' if d == date else '' }}">{{ d }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
  {% for g in groups %}
  <details class="cat" open>
    <summary>
      <span>{{ g.label }}</span>
      <span class="count">{{ g.articles|length }}</span>
      <span class="chev">▾</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for a in g.articles %}
      <article class="card">
        <a class="thumb" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {% if a.thumbnail %}<img src="{{ a.thumbnail }}" loading="lazy" alt=""
               onerror="this.remove()">{% endif %}
        </a>
        <div class="body">
          <a class="title" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ a.title }}</a>
          <p class="summary">{{ a.summary or a.raw_excerpt }}</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="src">{{ a.source }}</span>
            <a class="read" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">원문 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </details>
  {% else %}
  <p style="color:var(--sub);">이 날짜에는 수집된 기사가 없습니다.</p>
  {% endfor %}
</main>

<section class="feedback">
  <div class="fb-card">
    <h2>이 뉴스봇, 더 낫게 만들어 주세요</h2>
    {% if feedback_ready %}
    <p>주제·소스·요약 형식 등 개선 아이디어를 자유롭게 남겨 주세요.
       팀의 의견이 다음 업데이트에 반영됩니다.</p>
    <a class="fb-btn" href="{{ feedback_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">의견 보내기</a>
    {% else %}
    <p>관리자가 <code>config.yaml</code> 의 <code>feedback_form_url</code> 에 Google Form
       주소를 입력하면 여기에 의견 보내기 버튼이 표시됩니다.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<footer>AX 전략실 · 평일 오전 자동 발행 · 데이터 출처는 각 기사 원문 매체에 있습니다</footer>
</body>
</html>
